          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeremia te dok kwanyo buk adola ocele, te miyo baŋ Baruk ni myero co, Baruk wot a Neria, ame daŋ te coyo kun Jeremia tye akobe kop luŋ ame onwoŋo rik tye i buk adola ame Yekoyakim abaka me Juda rik obin owaŋo i mac-ca, Jeremia omemedo daŋ koppogo ocele iye ame rom aroma i maca me agege-ca.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.36.32"
            ]
          }
